v5. steady_clock CPU wall time. Work cost = controlled busy-wait (synthetic). Trace formatting disabled in slices; files written after runs.
Slice time covers: boundary checks, completion settlement, notice/event dispatch (incl. rejected delivery), commit, round promotion.
Host step time additionally covers close-state ticks. Producer offers and publications happen between steps, outside both timers.

